# Netflix Clone - By KingRosa 

> [!DISCLAIMER]
> This project is a feature-rich movie streaming interface built to demonstrate proficiency in modern front-end development, state management, and real-time database integration.
>  This project is 100% inspired by Netflix. It was developed for educational purposes to demonstrate front-end development, API integration, and Firebase authentication skills. I do not own any of the movie data or UI assets.


## 🚀 Live Demo
Check out the live application: [**Netflix Clone**]([https://netflix-clone-kingrosa-m69wexrst-kingrosas-projects.vercel.app/])

## 🛠 Tech Stack
* **Framework:** React.js (Create React App)
* **Authentication & Database:** Firebase (Auth, Firestore)
* **API Integration:** TMDB API (The Movie Database)
* **Styling:** CSS3 / Tailwind CSS
* **Deployment:** Vercel

## ✨ Key Features
* **Authentication System:** Secure sign-up/sign-in flows using Firebase Auth.
* **Real-Time Data:** Users can "like" or save movies, with data synced instantly to Firestore.
* **Dynamic Content:** Fetches trending, top-rated, and genre-specific movies directly from the TMDB API.
* **Responsive Design:** Fully optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile viewing.
* **Protected Routes:** User-only access to library features, ensuring a secure user experience.

